  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 102.01 Composition of the Board. The board shall consist of 5 members appointed by the governor with the consent of the council pursuant to RSA 328-I: 2, as amended.\n\nSource. #11091-A, eff 5-5-16",
